        "fr-extract.jsonl": [
            {
                "entry_id": "e3445813-bdaa-3557-b9dc-6a370534829f",
                "word": "orgueilleusement",
                "pos": "adv",
                "lang_code": "fr",
                "forms": [],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "b5599324-9e5f-3d09-8051-4b6bc14c0c35",
                        "entry_id": "e3445813-bdaa-3557-b9dc-6a370534829f",
                        "glosses": [
                            "D’une manière orgueilleuse."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "723e3404-5f86-4df6-a199-270676a1ac84",
                                "sense_id": "b5599324-9e5f-3d09-8051-4b6bc14c0c35",
                                "text": "Aussi, malgré l'envie qu'avait la vieille dame de promener orgueilleusement sa jolie nièce, finit-elle par renoncer à vouloir la mener dans le monde."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "ee9b872c-d5ef-4996-8f1b-f863f2aea573",
                                "sense_id": "b5599324-9e5f-3d09-8051-4b6bc14c0c35",
                                "text": "Et ce fut pour lui tout à coup une découverte incroyable ; il comprit […] que nulle part au monde il ne restait d’endroit où un Smallways pourrait orgueilleusement lever la tête, voter pour la guerre ou pour une politique étrangère énergique et intransigeante, et demeurer en sécurité, loin de ces atroces conséquences de son vote."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "c5cc2f91-a6e7-4941-8564-64dfa58d8cf6",
                        "source_entry_id": "e3445813-bdaa-3557-b9dc-6a370534829f",
                        "source_sense_id": "b5599324-9e5f-3d09-8051-4b6bc14c0c35",
                        "target_lang_word": "proudly",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "proudly",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "cb33f5d8-e21a-3ed4-991d-4e7f15456b7c",
                                        "entry_id": "9a7c49ee-21c8-38b8-8333-0d75904fe950",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "In a proud manner."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2c1cacc5-f16c-428b-93c3-b528282b2c91",
                                                "sense_id": "cb33f5d8-e21a-3ed4-991d-4e7f15456b7c",
                                                "text": "And with domes and pinnacles the dreams arose and stood up proudly between the river and the sky, all shimmering white to the morning."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d83fa8ce-64f6-487a-9f4a-6e8e681e5b67",
                                                "sense_id": "cb33f5d8-e21a-3ed4-991d-4e7f15456b7c",
                                                "text": "A word of warning: You might notice a few more unshaved upper lips proudly displayed by men in the next few weeks."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "83b3e28a-506b-444e-8afe-14b1cb257b94",
                                                "sense_id": "cb33f5d8-e21a-3ed4-991d-4e7f15456b7c",
                                                "text": "With such focus from within the footballing community this week on Remembrance Sunday, there was something appropriate about Colchester being the venue for last night’s game. Troops from the garrison town formed a guard of honour for both sets of players, who emerged for the national anthem with poppies proudly stitched into their tracksuit jackets."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "dcdc4210-2e20-4d56-aa94-ba472100f191",
                                                "sense_id": "cb33f5d8-e21a-3ed4-991d-4e7f15456b7c",
                                                "text": "\"We delivered [the project] £5 million under budget and on time,\" Hardwick says proudly."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "d4ef7a9e-bc56-4793-bdf3-32e99238471d",
                        "source_entry_id": "e3445813-bdaa-3557-b9dc-6a370534829f",
